Figure~\ref{fig:tsr_car_scatter} reveals spatial structure in the TSR-CAR plane.\label{sec:anticorrelation} Pi0-family models cluster in the upper-left (high CAR, near-zero TSR), Pi0.5 in the lower-right (high TSR, low CAR). The upper-right quadrant (high TSR \emph{and} CAR) represents genuinely safe behavior; the upper-left is accessible through action collapse alone. Under dfCAR, Pi0 configurations drop to the origin: the apparent safety-capability tradeoff was an artifact of action-collapse contamination.

